# Built fuzz binaries, and the working state of a run.
#
# The seed corpus is not checked in either: `scripts/fuzz.sh` builds it from `tests/programs/` and
# `tests/adversarial/`, which are already in the repository. A second copy of those files here would
# be one more thing to keep in step with them, and it would go stale the first time a program was
# added to the corpus.
